function Landing(){return <div className="landing"><header className="top"><Brand/><nav><a href="#workflow">How it works</a><a href="/studio" className="button">Open studio ↗</a></nav></header><main><div className="hero-copy"><span className="eyebrow"><i/> A focused workspace for video repair</span><h1>Keep the good.<br/><em>Change the rest.</em></h1><p>One frame. A few seconds. A single object.<br/>Bring your video, tell us what to change, and compare<br className="desktop"/> the result before it becomes your next revision.</p><a className="button primary" href="/studio">Start with your video <span>↗</span></a><small>Your original stays intact. Every revision stays yours.</small><a href="/studio" className="sample-entry">Or try the free practice clip in the studio →</a></div><div className="landing-live-demo"><LandingDemo originalUrl="/demo/higgsfield-sunset-original.mp4" editedUrl="/demo/higgsfield-sunset-picture-edit.mp4" duration={151/30} title="A warmer sunset. One selected moment." description="A real Higgsfield-generated scene edit applied from 1 to 4 seconds. Compare the saved result with the original. This changes the scene inside the range; it is not an object-only edit." badge="Higgsfield result" note="Previously generated with Higgsfield · selected range 01.0–04.0 · playback makes no generation request" kicker="Real picture edit" editedLabel="scene edit 01.0–04.0"/><LandingDemo originalUrl="/demo/higgsfield-sunset-original.mp4" editedUrl="/demo/higgsfield-sunset-audio-edit.mp4" duration={151/30} title="New sound. The picture stays." description="A saved Higgsfield audio-generation result applied from 1 to 4 seconds. Switch which version you hear while comparing the same moment." badge="Higgsfield audio" note="Previously generated with Higgsfield · soundtrack applied locally · no new generation charge" kicker="Real soundtrack edit" editedLabel="soundtrack 01.0–04.0"/><LandingDemo/></div><section id="workflow" className="workflow"><div><span>01 / IMPORT</span><h2>Start with what you have.</h2><p>Import a local video. Play, scrub, and find the exact moment that needs attention.</p></div><div><span>02 / REFINE</span><h2>Make room for precision.</h2><p>Edit sound, replace a picture range, or refine object boundaries with SAM 2. Review motion tracking and feature-based appearance matches before applying.</p></div><div><span>03 / COMPARE</span><h2>Only keep the better take.</h2><p>Compare your current revision with a candidate. Apply, undo, and download the result.</p></div></section></main><footer><Brand/><span>Built around the footage worth keeping.</span><a href="/studio">Enter the studio ↗</a></footer></div>}

